      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这件决胜服呢，\n让我穿在身上的不只是衣料。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d70dd5f2358668378f71bcc4e5a3deff00fab34cac1c327aaf24b3f81b07d59",
