    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00534904b031aa83c46b0ffc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成为一名至高无上的娱乐表演者，\n甚至打造出一个截然不同的世界──\n穿上衣服同时也是穿上这股决心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc5cb35336e2a4aeb5745d567edc0db68d1d04cca3511bd4f58ca8ffab87fc10",
