    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd84ca5bf394014d6c642fe6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了带来人人陶醉的舞台──也就是\n绝佳的比赛，往后我会继续奔驰下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "337580af7fdd5223d2f7b4be4b787940d3718c1ee03cbada8058e4620d0b2f1d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
