    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9e406b5d7d6d6f8c23d760e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "原来如此，偶像就该远远地欣赏……\n这种在一旁默默守护的行动也很赞──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c72ebf721f0a64029a1c202c310d897b3ad42718fe76bb269371384455db91a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cf08ab4ce6742141ed116c0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后──直到训练开始前，\n我一直观望着富士奇石，\n同时回想起收到决胜服那时的情景。",
